      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811600,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Publish Pipeline\nDeploy: Power Platform\nbackend\nSteps:\n1. Validate topics + entities\n2. Compile dialog tree →\nJSON\n3. Push to Dataverse bot\nconfig\n4. Register with Bot\nService\nRollback: version pinning",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a_publish",
      "originalText": "Publish Pipeline\nDeploy: Power Platform backend\nSteps:\n1. Validate topics + entities\n2. Compile dialog tree → JSON\n3. Push to Dataverse bot config\n4. Register with Bot Service\nRollback: version pinning",
