      "text": "Environment Manager\n(Power Platform\nEnvironments)\nDeploy: Dataverse-backed\nPaaS\nDev → Test → Prod\npromotion\nSolution export/import\n(ALM)\nDLP policies per\nenvironment\nGeo: data residency\nenforced",
