      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811600,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UC1: IT Helpdesk Agent\n(Deep Dive)\n• Password reset → Power\nAutomate → Graph API\n• Ticket creation →\nServiceNow connector\n• KB search → SharePoint +\nAI Search\n• Escalation to live agent\n(Omnichannel)\n• Tokens: avg\n6K/conversation\n• Latency: P50 1.2s (cached\nKB), P95 3.8s\n• Cost: $0.03/conversation\n(85% KB hit)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "uc1",
      "originalText": "UC1: IT Helpdesk Agent (Deep Dive)\n• Password reset → Power Automate → Graph API\n• Ticket creation → ServiceNow connector\n• KB search → SharePoint + AI Search\n• Escalation to live agent (Omnichannel)\n• Tokens: avg 6K/conversation\n• Latency: P50 1.2s (cached KB), P95 3.8s\n• Cost: $0.03/conversation (85% KB hit)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.887Z"
