      "updated": 1784359811600,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UC3: Sales Assistant (Deep\nDive)\n• CRM lookup → Dynamics\n365 connector\n• Quote generation → Power\nAutomate flow\n• Pipeline update →\nDataverse write\n• Meeting prep → Graph +\nLinkedIn\n• Tokens: avg 10K/conv (CRM\ncontext)\n• Corner case: stale CRM\ncache → live fetch\n• Corner case: large deal\n>$1M → approval flow",
