      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "uc3",
      "originalText": "UC3: Sales Assistant (Deep Dive)\n• CRM lookup → Dynamics 365 connector\n• Quote generation → Power Automate flow\n• Pipeline update → Dataverse write\n• Meeting prep → Graph + LinkedIn\n• Tokens: avg 10K/conv (CRM context)\n• Corner case: stale CRM cache → live fetch\n• Corner case: large deal >$1M → approval flow",
