      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure OpenAI Service\n(GPT-4o / GPT-4o-mini)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS\n(provisioned)\nTPM: 300K tokens/min per\nbot tenant\nEndpoint: POST\n/chat/completions\nAuth: managed identity\nUsed for: generative\nanswers, intent\nrouting, action selection",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c_aoai",
      "originalText": "Azure OpenAI Service\n(GPT-4o / GPT-4o-mini)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS (provisioned)\nTPM: 300K tokens/min per bot tenant\nEndpoint: POST /chat/completions\nAuth: managed identity\nUsed for: generative answers, intent\nrouting, action selection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.887Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "7il77o_gfrCHAv7Qte4Y5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3465.6397616710756,
      "y": -186.12835529711202,
      "width": 238.23985290527344,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1633947563,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1385173867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Content Safety Filter\nDeploy: Azure AI\nContent Safety PaaS\nPre+Post filter:\ntoxicity/PII/bias\nCustom blocklist per bot\nLatency: < 50ms\noverhead\nFalse positive: < 1.5%",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c_safety",
      "originalText": "Content Safety Filter\nDeploy: Azure AI Content Safety PaaS\nPre+Post filter: toxicity/PII/bias\nCustom blocklist per bot\nLatency: < 50ms overhead\nFalse positive: < 1.5%",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.887Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "w8MFMlsjutmgwaCHVUFZS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2903.765036092925,
      "y": 182.96241289782796,
      "width": 252.47984313964844,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 303266789,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1567571755,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Knowledge Base Service\n(RAG Pipeline for Copilot\nStudio)\nDeploy: AKS Pod, 15\nreplicas\nSources:\n• SharePoint sites/pages\n• Uploaded files\n(PDF/DOCX/HTML)\n• Dataverse tables\n• Public website URLs\nMax sources per bot: 500",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c_kb",
      "originalText": "Knowledge Base Service\n(RAG Pipeline for Copilot Studio)\nDeploy: AKS Pod, 15 replicas\nSources:\n• SharePoint sites/pages\n• Uploaded files (PDF/DOCX/HTML)\n• Dataverse tables\n• Public website URLs\nMax sources per bot: 500",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.887Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "vFrvwaq6cy5cvtdASGDnu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3714.509710042552,
      "y": 137.23005849591482,
      "width": 179.9198760986328,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 450431883,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1648155051,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure AI Search\n(Knowledge Index)\nDeploy: Managed\nPaaS (S2 tier)\n6 replicas, 2\npartitions\nHybrid: BM25 +\nHNSW vector\nSemantic ranker:\ncross-encoder\nIndex per bot\n(tenant-isolated)\nQuery P95 < 80ms",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c_aisearch",
      "originalText": "Azure AI Search\n(Knowledge Index)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS (S2 tier)\n6 replicas, 2 partitions\nHybrid: BM25 + HNSW vector\nSemantic ranker: cross-encoder\nIndex per bot (tenant-isolated)\nQuery P95 < 80ms",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.887Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "-Z1rIx1cua9vCBaGyJC6F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2949.9979605372764,
      "y": 553.1244971039355,
      "width": 261.1798400878906,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1387883013,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 983747499,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784359811603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Document Processing\nPipeline\n(Ingest + Chunk + Embed)\nDeploy: AKS Pod (batch\nworkers)\nChunking: 512 tokens, 50\noverlap\nModel: text-embedding-3-\nsmall (1536-d)\nTrigger: on KB source\nadd/update\nSLA: < 10 min for 100-page\nPDF\nOutput → AI Search index\n+ Blob",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c_embed",
      "originalText": "Document Processing Pipeline\n(Ingest + Chunk + Embed)\nDeploy: AKS Pod (batch workers)\nChunking: 512 tokens, 50 overlap\nModel: text-embedding-3-small (1536-d)\nTrigger: on KB source add/update\nSLA: < 10 min for 100-page PDF\nOutput → AI Search index + Blob",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.887Z"
    },
