      "text": "Chunk Store\n(Azure Blob Storage)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS\n(LRS)\nContainer: kb/{botId}/\n{sourceId}\nFormat: JSON (text +\nmetadata)\nLifecycle: delete on\nsource removal\nEncryption: CMK",
