      "originalText": "Chunk Store\n(Azure Blob Storage)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS (LRS)\nContainer: kb/{botId}/{sourceId}\nFormat: JSON (text + metadata)\nLifecycle: delete on source removal\nEncryption: CMK",
