      "updated": 1784359811604,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Microsoft Dataverse\n(Bot Config + Conversation\nLogs)\nDeploy: Power Platform\nManaged PaaS\nTables:\n• bot, botcomponent, topic,\nentity\n• conversationtranscript\n• botcontent (published\nsnapshot)\nPartition: per-environment\nRBAC: Dataverse security\nroles\nBackup: system-managed daily",
