      "originalText": "Microsoft Dataverse\n(Bot Config + Conversation Logs)\nDeploy: Power Platform Managed PaaS\nTables:\n• bot, botcomponent, topic, entity\n• conversationtranscript\n• botcontent (published snapshot)\nPartition: per-environment\nRBAC: Dataverse security roles\nBackup: system-managed daily",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T12:43:10.901Z",
