      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Power Automate\n(Cloud Flow Execution)\nDeploy: Power Platform PaaS\nTrigger: \"When Copilot calls a\nflow\"\n1400+ connectors available\nExecution: async w/ callback\nTimeout: 120s (configurable)\nDLP: connector groups\nenforced\nLicensing: included in Copilot\nStudio",
