      "text": "Microsoft Graph API\nDeploy: Microsoft Global PaaS\nUsed for:\n• SharePoint KB source crawl\n• User profile/presence lookup\n• Calendar/email actions\nAuth: delegated (user SSO) or\napp-only\nBatch: 20 req/batch\nThrottle: 10K req/10s/app",
