      "text": "Azure Blob Storage\n(KB Chunks + File Uploads)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS\n(LRS+GRS)\nContainer: kb/{botId}/\n{sourceId}\nTiering: Hot (active bots)\nEncryption: CMK (customer-\nmanaged)\nMax upload: 512MB per file\nImmutable for audit compliance",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
