      "originalText": "Azure Blob Storage\n(KB Chunks + File Uploads)\nDeploy: Managed PaaS (LRS+GRS)\nContainer: kb/{botId}/{sourceId}\nTiering: Hot (active bots)\nEncryption: CMK (customer-managed)\nMax upload: 512MB per file\nImmutable for audit compliance",
