      "locked": false,
      "text": "Application Insights\n(Bot Analytics + Telemetry)\nDeploy: Azure Monitor PaaS\nMetrics: sessions, resolution\nrate,\nescalation %, CSAT, avg turns\nCustom events per\ntopic/action\nKQL queries for drill-down\nRetention: 90 days default",
