      "text": "LEGEND:\n█ Blue box = Channel / Authoring\ncomponent\n█ Purple box = Runtime Engine service\n(AKS Pod)\n█ Orange box = AI / Knowledge service\n○ Red ellipse = Managed PaaS Data\nStore (NO VMs)\n█ White box = Sub-component / detail\nnode\n─── Thick solid = main request flow\n(L→R)\n- - - Dashed = data access / async\npath\nProtocols: HTTPS/443, gRPC/mTLS,\nRESP3/6380,\nAMQP/5671, Bot Framework Activity",
