      "originalText": "LEGEND:\n█ Blue box = Channel / Authoring component\n█ Purple box = Runtime Engine service (AKS Pod)\n█ Orange box = AI / Knowledge service\n○ Red ellipse = Managed PaaS Data Store (NO VMs)\n█ White box = Sub-component / detail node\n─── Thick solid = main request flow (L→R)\n- - - Dashed = data access / async path\nProtocols: HTTPS/443, gRPC/mTLS, RESP3/6380,\nAMQP/5671, Bot Framework Activity",
      "autoResize": true,
