    {
      "id": "SmkNDNHmAJBir1KQ4VfGd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1743.685174279462,
      "y": 1614.6240063293276,
      "width": 539.2196655273438,
      "height": 1350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1624336107,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 201044267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784374939748,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UC1: IT HELPDESK AGENT — End-to-End Flow\n\nSCENARIO A: Password Reset\n1. User: \"I need to reset my password\"\n2. Topic Resolver: CLU matches intent=PasswordReset\n(confidence 0.92)\n3. Entity Extractor: no entities needed (self-service)\n4. Dialog Engine: executes PasswordReset topic\n(waterfall)\n5. Step 1: Confirm identity → prompt for employee ID\n6. Step 2: Validate employee ID via Power Automate\nflow:\n   Flow: GET /users/{employeeId} (Graph API\nconnector)\n   If not found → \"Employee not found\" → retry or\nescalate\n7. Step 3: Trigger password reset via Power Automate:\n   Flow: POST /users/{id}/authentication/methods\n(Graph API)\n   Generates temporary password + sends via email\n8. Step 4: Return Adaptive Card with instructions\n9. Latency: 1.8s total (0.1s CLU + 0.2s slot fill + 1.5s\nPA flow)\n\nSCENARIO B: KB Search (\"How do I set up VPN?\")\n1. Topic Resolver: CLU confidence 0.55 (below 0.7\nthreshold)\n2. Falls through to Generative Orchestrator\n3. Grounding Service queries AI Search:\n   • Hybrid query: BM25(\"VPN setup\") +\nvector(embedding)\n   • Returns top-5 chunks from IT KB SharePoint site\n4. Prompt Builder assembles: system + 5 chunks + user\nquestion\n5. Azure OpenAI generates grounded answer (GPT-4o-\nmini, 4K tokens)\n6. Citation Engine: maps response → source URLs [1]\n[2]\n7. Content Safety: post-filter checks (pass)\n8. Adaptive Card: answer + citation links + \"Was this\nhelpful?\" feedback\n9. Latency: 3.2s total (0.1s CLU + 0.3s search + 2.5s\nLLM + 0.3s cite)\n\nSCENARIO C: Escalation to Live Agent\n1. User: \"I need to talk to someone\"\n2. Topic Resolver: matches Escalation topic\n3. Handoff Module: transfers to Omnichannel for\nCustomer Service\n   • Full transcript attached to agent workspace\n   • Skills-based routing: IT Support queue\n   • Wait time estimate shown to user\n4. Agent picks up in Dynamics 365 workspace with full\ncontext",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "flow_uc1",
      "originalText": "UC1: IT HELPDESK AGENT — End-to-End Flow\n\nSCENARIO A: Password Reset\n1. User: \"I need to reset my password\"\n2. Topic Resolver: CLU matches intent=PasswordReset (confidence 0.92)\n3. Entity Extractor: no entities needed (self-service)\n4. Dialog Engine: executes PasswordReset topic (waterfall)\n5. Step 1: Confirm identity → prompt for employee ID\n6. Step 2: Validate employee ID via Power Automate flow:\n   Flow: GET /users/{employeeId} (Graph API connector)\n   If not found → \"Employee not found\" → retry or escalate\n7. Step 3: Trigger password reset via Power Automate:\n   Flow: POST /users/{id}/authentication/methods (Graph API)\n   Generates temporary password + sends via email\n8. Step 4: Return Adaptive Card with instructions\n9. Latency: 1.8s total (0.1s CLU + 0.2s slot fill + 1.5s PA flow)\n\nSCENARIO B: KB Search (\"How do I set up VPN?\")\n1. Topic Resolver: CLU confidence 0.55 (below 0.7 threshold)\n2. Falls through to Generative Orchestrator\n3. Grounding Service queries AI Search:\n   • Hybrid query: BM25(\"VPN setup\") + vector(embedding)\n   • Returns top-5 chunks from IT KB SharePoint site\n4. Prompt Builder assembles: system + 5 chunks + user question\n5. Azure OpenAI generates grounded answer (GPT-4o-mini, 4K tokens)\n6. Citation Engine: maps response → source URLs [1][2]\n7. Content Safety: post-filter checks (pass)\n8. Adaptive Card: answer + citation links + \"Was this helpful?\" feedback\n9. Latency: 3.2s total (0.1s CLU + 0.3s search + 2.5s LLM + 0.3s cite)\n\nSCENARIO C: Escalation to Live Agent\n1. User: \"I need to talk to someone\"\n2. Topic Resolver: matches Escalation topic\n3. Handoff Module: transfers to Omnichannel for Customer Service\n   • Full transcript attached to agent workspace\n   • Skills-based routing: IT Support queue\n   • Wait time estimate shown to user\n4. Agent picks up in Dynamics 365 workspace with full context",
