      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UC3: SALES ASSISTANT — End-to-End Flow\n\nSCENARIO A: CRM Lookup (\"Show me Contoso's\npipeline\")\n1. User: \"What’s the status of the Contoso deal?\"\n2. Topic Resolver: CLU matches intent=CRMLookup\n(confidence 0.88)\n3. Entity Extractor: extracts company=Contoso\n(custom list entity)\n4. Dialog Engine: executes CRMLookup topic\n5. Action Runtime: invokes Dynamics 365 connector via\nPower Automate\n   Flow: GET /opportunities?$filter=account eq\n'Contoso'\n   Auth: delegated token (user’s Dynamics 365\npermissions)\n6. Results: 3 open deals, total pipeline $2.1M\n7. Adaptive Card: table with deal name, stage, value,\nclose date\n8. Latency: 2.1s (0.1s CLU + 0.3s entity + 1.7s D365\nAPI call)\n\nSCENARIO B: Quote Generation\n1. User: \"Generate a quote for Contoso, 50 Enterprise\nlicenses\"\n2. Entities: company=Contoso, product=Enterprise,\nqty=50\n3. Power Automate flow:\n   Step 1: GET product catalog → price = $299/license\n   Step 2: Calculate: 50 × $299 = $14,950 (apply 10%\nvolume discount)\n   Step 3: POST /quotes → create quote record in\nDataverse\n   Step 4: Generate PDF via Word template connector\n4. Adaptive Card: quote summary + PDF download link\n5. Latency: 4.5s (complex flow with 4 connector calls)\n\nSCENARIO C: Meeting Prep\n1. User: \"Prep me for my Contoso meeting tomorrow\"\n2. Generative Orchestrator: auto-selects 3 actions\n(generative actions)\n   Action 1: Graph API → GET /me/calendar (find\nmeeting details)\n   Action 2: D365 connector → GET /contacts\n(attendee profiles)\n   Action 3: LinkedIn connector → GET /people (recent\nposts)\n3. Prompt Builder: combines all action results as\ngrounding context\n4. GPT-4o generates briefing: attendees, deal history,\ntalking points\n5. Adaptive Card: structured briefing with sections\n6. Latency: 5.8s (3 parallel API calls + 2.5s LLM\ngeneration)\n\nCorner case: Stale CRM data → cache TTL 5 min, live\nfetch on miss\nCorner case: Deal >$1M → triggers approval flow before\nquote creation",
